      "desc": ">  ## ↷✦; w e l c o m e ❞        \n\n![Belial](nothing)           \n![Belial](nothing)   \n![Belial](nothing)           \n\n![Belial](nothing)       \n![Belial](noobably autistic)\n\nAttachment style\n- Fearful Avoidant \n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n☾︎ ✰ ¯\\_(ツ)_/¯ 𖨆 ᕕ( ᐛ )ᕗ 𓆈  ☠︎︎  ☽︎\n\n\n**WARNINGS:** \n> we have lots of pictures and information, we put great care in our account here, and would love you to notice and take your time to appreciate that <3 (it's more complicated than what it looks like)\n\n> the majority of content in this account is in Italian since it's made for ourselves and for our closest friends. If you don't speak Italian, you can use google lens to translate.\n\n> there are little to no trigger warnings, so be careful. There aren't any in depth talk about them, but they can get mentioned in certain profiles. \n\n> we are disrespectful, aggressive and rude to our headmates, but it's not a problem, we've always done that and it's usually as a joke.\n>> We would never be like that with others outside the system.\n\n> MESSY FRONTERS!! we do not decide who fronts, do not have an host and it's just chaos. Do not ask for alter x to front because we can't control that.\n>> We are currently working on alters reintegration, less splits and therefore an easier system to live in.\n\n> FINAL GOAL: healthy and stable multiplicity with less than 30 alters, so that everyone can front and have their time. \n>> At the moment that's something which is stressing us a lot since it's hard to keep relationships like this.",
